Keep session objects as __PHP_Incomplete_Class during session upload progress.
php_session_rfc1867_update() decodes and re-encodes the session before RINIT,
when no user code may run; php-src keeps every object incomplete there, igbinary
still autoloaded classes, called unserialize_callback_func, __wakeup(),
__unserialize() and Serializable::unserialize(), and destroyed sessions holding
Serializable objects of not yet declared classes.

Bug: https://github.com/php/php-src/security/advisories/GHSA-w8hw-w9fx-j79w
See-also: https://github.com/php/php-src/commit/3584a98bda0f

